      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement envelope encryption using a managed key service, I will use AWS KMS (Key Management Service) as the external provider. This choice is based on the requirement to use a concrete external provider and make it identifiable in the code. AWS KMS is a widely used service for managing cryptographic keys and performing encryption and decryption operations. </thinking>\n",
