        "text": "<thinking> To decrypt a ciphertext payload with a managed key, I need to choose a concrete external provider. Amazon Web Services (AWS) offers a managed service for encryption and decryption through AWS Key Management Service (KMS). I will use the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with AWS KMS. The provider will be identifiable through the import of the Boto3 library and the use of AWS KMS-specific functions. </thinking>\n",
